2026-11-08  G. Branden Robinson <g.branden.robinson@gmail.com>

	* src/roff/troff/input.cpp (file_iterator::close): Raise a
	ruckus on failed closure of a file stream or pipeline.  If basic
	operating system services are failing us, we want the user to
	know about it.  Throw error diagnostic if fclose(3) or pclose(3)
	fail.

2026-11-08  G. Branden Robinson <g.branden.robinson@gmail.com>

	* src/roff/troff/input.cpp (file_iterator::file_iterator): Drop
	tautologically false conditional.  Since commit 83e83786d9, 17
	October, we have already returned from the constructor under the
	circumstance it tests.



